#showas:降临万物的天灾
A more specialist scenario. Mainly you and one AI, and it's set to difficulty 7.

This is on the "honeycomb" map type, with 80 planets. Full Ensemble AI type.
Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

Lots of factions in this one, including two teams of them in addition to your team and the AI.

You have a friendly Scourge faction, the AI has one for itself as well. There is also a team of Marauders and some Scourge, then a second team of the same.

Marauders are human pirates that will occasionally appear and attack everyone, with the goal of capturing the planet to use as a base to strengthen themselves.

The Scourge is a new creation of collected and absorbed races, mutilated into hideous forms for each one

The Zenith Trader is also wandering around as a neutral third party, selling big weapons and defensive items to you or the AI as it goes. Make sure to visit the Build tab when it is on one of your planets.